# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Syntax: [source] [destination] [status].
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Hand-written rules. The build appends one 301 per route for the
# trailing-slash form (/about/ to /about), generated from ROUTE_META, so the
# address with no slash is the only one that answers 200.
#
# Old case study links (/work#slug, and the renamed slugs finpulse and
# financetracker) carry the slug in the hash, which never reaches the server.
# They are forwarded in the browser by src/components/RouteEffects.tsx.

